  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat(docs): scaffold shared mkdocs theme and workflow 2026-04-01\n- feat: add MEAI guide template to autosdk init scaffolding 2026-03-29\n- feat: support dotted schema namespaces (#198) 2026-03-28\n- feat: add TreatWarningsAsErrors to SDK project template 2026-03-27\n- feat: Inline array support and deepObject serialization for object query params 2026-03-22\n- feat: Extract inline object schemas from bindings and skip object-type query params 2026-03-21\n- feat: Extract inline enum schemas from bindings.ws.query to components 2026-03-21\n- feat: Support inline schemas in bindings.ws.query + snapshot test 2026-03-21\n- feat: Generate typed ConnectAsync with query params from AsyncAPI channel bindings 2026-03-21\n- feat: Native upstream AsyncAPI spec support — inline payloads, per-channel servers, operationTraits 2026-03-21\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: detect grpc proto inputs explicitly 2026-04-02\n- fix: normalize fern literal and datetime types 2026-04-02\n- fix: suppress obsolete converter warnings in stj clients 2026-04-02\n- fix: honor fern request names for request models 2026-04-02\n- fix: fall back from huge generated json contexts 2026-04-02\n- fix: make security scheme overrides authoritative 2026-04-02\n- fix: normalize openapi 3.1 numeric bounds before parse 2026-04-02\n- fix: expand templated server defaults 2026-04-02\n- fix: name mixed union members from generated types 2026-04-02\n- fix: deserialize primitive responses without model helpers 2026-04-02",
